                    {
                      "texts": [
                        {
                          "tag": "p",
                          "value": "If you want to witness the chaotic good of my original guest appearance which led to this show, watch of , recorded on Feb 25th along with , , and Leo. I dialed down the chaos considerably for the Off By One show, but for this one, I personally think it's funnier to watch Paris' reaction to me for the entire show."
